      "t": "Emma, the producer of Gabor's film, confronts Andréa after Françoise has withdrawn. Her co-star refuses to act without her, and years of work may collapse. Andréa promises to bring Françoise back, then struggles to record an apology on her voicemail. First, listen to the argument in French.",
